 Bubble Sort:
Greatest ele will be in last 
loop will start from end


 for (int i = n - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
        for (int j = 0; j <= i - 1; j++) {
            if (arr[j] > arr[j + 1]) {
                int temp = arr[j + 1];
                arr[j + 1] = arr[j];
                arr[j] = temp;
            }
        }
